<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- TongaTranslation Project</book>
  <para style="h">BaHebburu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lugwalo kuBaHebburu</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaHebburu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hebb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lugwalo Ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">BAHEBBURU</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">Bbuku lyabaHebberu ndugwalo lwakusungwaazya oolo lutondezya nzila Jesu njakazuzukizya aayo businsimi busiyenesiyene buli muchizuminano chakale. Lwakalembwa mbuli nkambawuko. Kuli zyiinda kumakumi musanu akkumi limwi zitondeka muchizuminano chakale mubbuku lyaBaHebburu eeyo itondezya antanganana munzila Jesu mbwakazuzukizya businsimi amilimu yamupayizi mupati wachiJuda. Nkaambo kacheechi, bbuku lyakali lyakusungwazya banaKkirisitu bachiJuda. Ibbuku lyaBaHebburu lutondeezya Jesu mbwakazuzukizya mulawu kuchitila kuti bapayizi kabatachipayili limbi pe. Jesu wakali chipayizyo chazibi zyoonse, lumwi alimwi kwalyoonse. BanaKkirisitu bachiindi chesu balakonzya kujana kusungwazigwa mulugwalo oolu lwabaHebburu kuchitila kuti kabaya butobela Jesu Kkirisitu mbuli kuti nguwe utukonzesya kuti tusyome muli Leza, akuti katuchiya busyoma mulinguwe (BaHebburu 12:2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Taakwe uzi pe kuti ngwani wakalemba bbuku lyaBaHebburu, pesi basikufunkununa bayeyela kuti nga ulaba mutumwa Pawulu, Lukku aBbanabbasi. Alimwi buzuba bwakulembwa kwalyo tabuzibikene pe pesi bayingi basyoma kuti lwakalembwa kakutanasika minyaka makumi musanu amakumi aabili kuzwa kukuzyalwa kwaJesu. Jerusalemu yakanyonyoonwa mumunyaka wamakumi musanu amakumi aabili kuzwa kukuzyalwa kwaJesu, pesi mulembi walugwalo oolu waambuula atala aJerusalemu mbuli uleezyanga teeyakalina nyonyoonwa pe. Lugwalo lyaBaHebburu lwakalembelwa muchisi chaRoma (BaHebburu 13:24) mpawo lwakeendelela mumbungano zyiingi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Mulembi utondeezya kuti Jesu ngumupati kubasinsimi baLeza akubaangelo (BaHebburu 1:1—4:13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo wiinkilila anembo akutondeezya kuti Jesu mupati kubapayizi babeleka muŋanda yaLeza muJerusalemu (BaHebburu 4:14—7:28)</para>
  <para style="io1">Alubo mulimu waJesu mupati kwiinda chizuminano chakale eecho Leza nchakachita abantu bakwe mukwiinda mumulawu ooyo ngwakapa Mozesi (BaHebburu 8:1—10:31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Naakamana kupandulula kuti Jesu mupati kuli zyoonse, mulembi upa malayilile asiyenesiyene ajatika (BaHebburu 10:32—13:17)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kumamanino mulembi umanisya lugwalo ansungwazyo akujuzya (BaHebburu 13:18-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Ijwi LyaLeza Mukwiinda muMwana Wakwe Mulombe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Muchiindi chakayinda, Leza wakali kwaambuula kale kumataata mukwiinda mubasinsimi munzila zyiingi zisiyenesiyene, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />pesi mumazuba aaya ayinda wakaambuula kulindiswe mukwiinda muMwana Mulombe, ooyo ngwaakasala kuti abe sikukona wazintu zyoonse, ooyo mukwiinda mulinguwe alubo wakalenga nyika. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Nguunguwe utondeezya bulemu bwaLeza alimwi ujisi chisinizyo chabube bwakwe, mpawo ujisi mulengalenga ajwi lyakwe lyanguzu. Naakasalazya nkaambo kazibi, wakakkala kuluboko lwakululyo lwaSinguzu Usumpukide.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bupati BwaMwana Mulombe waLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Mwana Mulombe waLeza kaali waba ujisi nguzu kubaangelo mbuli izina ndyakakona ipati kwiinda lyabo. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Int 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Mak 17:13</ref>.</char></note> Nkaambo kuli uuli mungelo Leza nkwaakati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Iwe uliMwana wangu Mulombe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">sunu ndakuzyala”? Nikuba alubo,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">“Ndiyooba Wisi kulinguwe, alimwi uyooba mwana kulindime”?<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Det 32:43</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:7">Int 97:7</ref>.</char>
    </note> Alimwi alubo, Leza natayete Mwana wakwe mutaanzi munyika, waamba kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Amuleke baangelo baLeza boonse bamukombe.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:4">Int 104:4</ref>.</char>
    </note> Kubaangelo Leza waamba kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Ooyo uchita baangelo bakwe kuti babe myuuwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">alimwi balanda bakwe kuti babe mabangabanga amulilo.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 45:6-7">Int 45:6-7</ref>.</char>
    </note> Pesi Leza atala aMwana wakwe Mulombe waamba kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Chuuno chanu chabwami, O Leza, nchalyoonse alyoonse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">musako wanu ululeme musako wabwami bwanu.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Inywe nimwaakayanda bululami mpawo mwasula bubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">nchiinchicho Leza, Leza wako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">wakakunanika amafuta alukondo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ayinda ngaakapa aabo mbulaabo.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Alimwi wakati, “Inywe, Mwami, ndinywe mwakabikka intalisyo yanyika kumatalikilo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">alimwi majulu njiimilimu yamaboko aanu.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Eezi zyoonse ziyooloba, pesi inywe munooliwo kwalyoonse.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Zintu zyoonse ziyookulumpala mbuli chisamo,<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />uyoozivunga mbuli muntu uvunga chisamo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">alimwi bayoozwaatununwa mbuli majansi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Pesi inywe munooli mbuli mbumubede,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">alayo minyaka yanu tayikwe kuyoojinka pe.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Int 110:1</ref>.</char>
    </note> Kuli bali baangelo Leza nkwakati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Kkala kuluboko lwangu lwakululyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">mane ndikachite basinkondonyokwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">bakabe chilyatilo chamawulu aako”?<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Eelyo, baangelo tee myuuya ikutawukila Leza na, yakatumwa anguwe kuti izookutawukile, nkaambo kabaabo beelede kuyookona lufutuko?<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Lufutuko Lupati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Nchiinchicho nchitweelede kuswiilizya kapati kuli eezyo nzitwakamvwa, kuchitila kuti tutasunzulusigwi kuzwa kulindulo. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Nkaambo kuti ijwi lyakaambwa abaangelo kuli bamataata besu lyakali lyachoonzyo kufumbwa utakwe wakaliswiilizya nikuba kulitobelezya watambula chisubulo chimweelede, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />eelyo tuyoochija biyeni kuti twasiya lufutuko lupati oolu? Lufutuko oolu lwakaambwa lutaanzi mukwiinda muMwami, alimwi lwakasinizigwa kuti ndwachoonzyo kulindiswe abaabo bakamumvwa. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Alakwe Leza wakapa bukamboni azitondeezyo amalele azigambyo zisiyene alimwi azipo zyaMuuya Usalala nzyakaabila mukwiinda mukuyanda kwakwe.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ooyo Ututola Kulufutuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Nkaambo Leza teekwakali kubaangelo pe ooko nkwakafwiinsya inyika ichiyobuza, eeyo njitwaambuula. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Int 8:4-6</ref>.</char></note> Pesi kwakaambwa bukamboni mumalembe kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Muntu niinzi O Leza ngulikataazya atala anguwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">nikuba mwana amuntu, ooyo ngubamba?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Wakamuchita kuti abe munsi lyabaangelo kwakayindi kaniini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">mpawo wakamusamika abulemu akulemekwa,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />wakabikka zyoonse munsi amawulu aakwe.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Lino mukubikka zintu zyoonse munsi lyakwe, Leza takukwe nchaakasiya pe anze abweendelezi bwakwe. Mbuli mbukubede, tatuna bona zintu zyoonse pe zili munsi abweendelezi bwakwe. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Pesi tubona Jesu, ooyo kwakayindi kaniini wakabikkwa munsi kwiinda baangelo, lino usamikidwe abulemu akulemekwa nkaambo kakupenzegwa kwalufu, kuchitila kuti aluzyalo lwaLeza Jesu akafwe nkaambo kabantu boonse.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Nkaambo kwakali kweelela kuti we Leza, nkaambo kakwe alimwi mulinguwe zintu zyoonse mpuzili, mukweeta bana bayingi kubulemu, kuti abe mutaanzi wakweeta lufutuko lwabo lululeme mukwiinda mukupenzegwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Nkaambo kufumbwa usalazya abaabo basalazigwa boonse bajisi chisiko chimwi. Nchiinchicho nchatakwe bweeme kubayita kuti nimpuli iimwi, <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Int 22:22</ref>.</char></note> waamba kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Ndiyoobaambila bantu bakulindiswe anzuwachita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">mukati kambungano ndiyokulumbayizya.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Ay 8:17-18</ref>.</char>
    </note> Alimwi alubo waamba kuti, “Ndiyobikka lusyomo lwangu muliLeza.” Alimwi alubo waamba kuti, “Ndili aano, abana aabo Leza mbaakandipa.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Nkikaako mbukunga bana balaabilana mumubili amubulowa, we lwakwe Jesu mbukubede wakaba muchiimo chamubili mbuli mbabo, kuchitila kuti mukwiinda mulufu akonzye kunyonyoona ooyo ujisi inguzu zyalufu, kaali nguwe, Sikuchenga, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />alimwi kuti aangunune aabo bakali mubuzike buumi bwabo boonse nkaambo kakuyoowa lufu. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8-9">Ay 41:8-9</ref>.</char></note> Nkaambo choonzyo tagwasyi ankaambo kabaangelo pe pesi ankaambo kazyalane lyaAbburahamu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Nkikaako wakaleelede kuchitwa mbuli babunyina munzila yoonse, kuchitila kuti abe mupayizi mupati uli aluse akusyomeka mumulimu waLeza, kuti abe chipayizyo chazibi zyabantu. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Nkaambo we lwakwe wakapenzegwa naakasunkwa, eelyo ulakonzya kugwasya aabo basunkwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Mupati Kwiinda Mozesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Nkikaako, nibakwesu basalala, aabo baabilana mulwiito lwaLeza, kamuyeeya Jesu, mutumwa amupayizi mupati wakulyambilila kwesu. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">My 12:7</ref>.</char></note> Wakali syomekede kuli ooyo wakamusala, mbuli Mozesi alubo wakali syomekede mumulimu waLeza. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Anukuti Jesu ujisi bulemu kwiinda Mozesi mbuli muyaki waŋanda mbwayinda bulemu bwaŋanda lwayo. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Nkaambo ŋanda yoonse iyakwa awumwi muntu, pesi muyaki wazintu zyoonse nguLeza. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">My 12:7</ref>.</char></note> Nichoonzyo Mozesi wakali kusyomeka muli zyoonse kubantu baLeza mbuli mulanda, mukupa bukamboni kuzintu eezyo zyakali kuyoowambwa kuchiindi chiboola. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Pesi Kkirisitu wakasyomeka mulubuwa lwaŋanda yaLeza atala azyoonse eezyo nzyakamulayilila mbuli Mwana Mulombe. Alimwi tuli ŋanda yaLeza iswe nutusyoma kuti twakakatila abusichaamba atala azeezyo nzitulangilila.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulyookezya Kwabantu BaLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Int 95:7-11</ref>.</char>
    </note> Nkikaako, mbuli Muuya Usalala mbuwamba, kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Sunu, kuti mwamvwa ijwi lyaLeza,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />mutayumyi myoyo yanu, mbuli mubupapi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">mubuzuba nibakamusunka munkanda,<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />ooko bamawuso nkubakandisunka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">nikuba kuti bakabona milimu yangu kwaminyaka ilimakumi aane.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Nkikaako ndakanyema azyalane eelyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">mpawo ndakati, ‘Balaleya chiindi choonse mumyoyo yabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">teebakaziba inzila zyangu pe.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Ndakakonka mubukali bwangu kanditi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Tabakwe kuyoonjila pe mukulyokezya kwangu.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Ngamuchenjele, nibakwesu, kuti kutabi naba umwi mubi akati kanu, ulaamoyo utasyomi, umuleesya kuzwa kuli Leza muumi. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Pesi kamusungwazyaniya mazuba woonse, nikuchaaambwa kuti “sunu,” kuchitila kuti kutabi umwi wanu uba sichinguni nkaambo kalweeneno lwachibi. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Nkaambo tulaabilana muli Kkirisitu, kuti twajatisya lusinizyo lwesu lwakutanguna mane kumamanino, <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Int 95:7-8</ref>.</char></note> mbuli mbwaamba malembe kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Sunu, kuti mwamvwa ijwi lyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">mutayumyi myoyo yanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">mbuli mubupapi.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">My 14:1-35</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mbaani aabo bakamvwa alimwi kakuli mbapapi? Tee boonse na aabo bakasiya Ijiputi kiili aansi abuzulidi bwaMozesi? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29">My 14:29</ref>.</char></note> Mbaani aabo bakamunyemya kwaminyaka ilimakumi aane? Teebaabona bakabisya, bali amibili yakaloba munkanda? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Alimwi nkuulini nkwakakonka kuti tabeelede kunjila mukulyokezya kwakwe, pesi nkuuli baabo batalemeki? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Aboobo tubona kuti bakakachilwa kunjila nkaambo kakutasyoma kwabo.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Nkikaako, Leza wakatupa chisyomezyo chakwe kuti tukanjile mukulyookezya kwakwe, atuyoowe mbukunga umwi wanu ulabetekwa kukukachilwa kuchijana. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Nkaambo makani mabotu akaza kulindiswe mbuli kulimbabo, pesi makani ngibakamvwa tee akabagwasya pe, nkaambo teebakaabilana lusyomo pe lwabaabo bakali kuswiilila. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Int 95:11</ref>.</char></note> Nkaambo iswe nitwakasyoma tunjila mukulyookezya ooko, mbuli Leza mbwakaamba kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Mbuli mbundakakonka mulunyemo lwangu kuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Choonzyo tabakoyoonjila mukulyookezya kwangu,’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Nikuba kuti milimu yakwe yakali yamanisigwa kuzwa kumalengelo anyika. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Matl 2:2</ref>.</char></note> Nkaambo Leza muli aamwi malembe waamba kuti atala abuzuba bwamusanu aabili, “Alimwi Leza wakalyookezya mubuzuba bwamusanu aabili kuzwa kumilimu yakwe yoonse.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Int 95:11</ref>.</char></note> Alubo waamba kuti, “Choonzyo tabakoyoonjila mukulyokezya kwangu.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Nkikaako mbukunga kuchili mweenya wakuti bamwi bakanjile mukulyookezya, alimwi aabo bataanzi kukutambula makani mabotu bakakachilwa kunjila nkaambo kakutaswiilila, <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Int 95:7-8</ref>.</char></note> nkaambo kacheechi, Leza wakabamba chimwi chiindi chibotu mpawo wakachuunika kuti, “Sunu,” nikwakayinda chiindi chilamfu wakaambuula atala acheechi akupa Devidi kuti aambuule majwi akali aambuulwa kale mumalembe kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Sunu, naa mwalimvwa ijwi lyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">mutayumyi myoyo yanu.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Nkaambo kuti Josuwa wakabapa kulyookezya, Leza nikuli takaambula pe muchiindi chitobela atala abuzuba bumbi. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Aboobo eelyo, kwachaala sabata yakulyookezya kwabantu baLeza, <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Matl 2:2</ref>.</char></note> nkaambo kufumbwa unjila mukulyookezya kwaLeza alubo ulaleka kubeleka mbuli Leza mbwaakachita kuli zyakwe. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Nkikaako atusungwaale kunjila mukulyookezya ooko, kuchitila kuti kutabi usweka anzila iliboobo yakutaswilila.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Nkaambo ijwi lyaLeza lilapona alimwi lilabeleka, lilimbuli ipanga libosya kwiinda ipanga libosya mabazu woonse, liyasa mane kupambukaniya kwabuumi amuuya amafuwa amumpolyo, akuyanduula miyeeyo aziyanda moyo. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Alimwi kunembo lyakwe taakwe chilengwa chisisidwe, pesi zyoonse zili antanganana akubikkwa kumeso aakwe ooyo ngutweelede kuyoopandulwida eezyo nzitwakachita.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mupayizi Mupati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Eelyo mbukunga tujisi mupayizi mupati loko wakayinda mumajulu, Jesu, Mwana Mulombe waLeza, atujatisye kulyaaambilila kwesu. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Nkaambo tatukwe mupayizi mupati utakonzyi kuba aluzyalo mukukompama kwesu, pesi ooyo ulaabulemu boonse wakasunkwa munzila zyoonse mbuli mbutusunkwa, nikuba oobo taakwe naakabisya pe. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Eelyo ngatuswene afwiifwi abusichaamba kuchuuno chaluzyalo, kuti tukatambule luse akujana luzyalo lutugwasya muchiindi chakubula.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Nkaambo woonse mupayizi mupati usalwa akati kabantu usalilwa kukwiimikilila bantu zili mubulyidilani kuli Leza, kuti ape zipo azipayizyo zyazibi. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Ulakonzya kuchita chabuteteete abatakwe luzibo abasweekede, mbukunga lwakwe ulikompeme abubi. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Nkaambo kacheechi ulaangidwe kuti ape chipayizyo chazibi zyakwe antoomwe azeezyo zyabantu. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Alimwi takukwe ubweza lulemeko oolu mwini, pesi ooyo uyiitwa aLeza, mbuli Aroni mbwakalibede.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Aboobo alakwe Kkirisitu teewakalisumpula pe kuti achitwe mupayizi mupati, pesi Leza wakati kulinguwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Nduwe Mwana wangu Mulombe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">sunu ndakuzyala”;<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />mbuli mbwaamba lubo muli bumwi busena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Nduwe mupayizi walyoonse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">mumabambe aMelikkizedeki.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Mumazuba abuumi bwakwe, Jesu wakapa nkombyo akukumbilila, akoompolola kupati amisozi, kulinguwe wakali kukonzya kumufutula kuzwa kulufu, alimwi wakamvwigwa nkaambo kakuyoowa kwakwe kwabunaleza. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Nikuba kuti wakali Mwana Mulombe, wakayiya kuswiilila mukwiinda muli eezyo nzyakapenzegwa; <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />alimwi kachitidwe ululeme wakaba chisiko chalufutuko lutamani kuli boonse aabo bamuswilila, <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />kaali wasalwa mupayizi mupati aLeza mbuli mumabambe aMelikkizedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Machenjezyo Atala Akutaba Alusyomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Atala acheechi tujisi zyiingi zyakwaamba kaziliziyumu kuzipandulula, mbukunga mwaba baduntide kukumvwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Nkaambo nikuba achiindi eechi mweelede kuba bayiisi, mweelede umwi utamuyiisye lubo malayilile antalisyo ajwi lyaLeza. Muyanda makupa, peepe kulya kuyumu; <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />nkaambo woonse upona amakupa takwe luzibo pe mujwi lyabusalali, nkaambo uchili muvwanda. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Pesi kulya kuyumu nkwabakakomena, nkaambo aabo bayiisigwa akuchita balakonzya kusiyanisya akati kabubotu abubi.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Nkikaako atuleke injiisyo yantalisyo yaKkirisitu mpawo tuyinke kunembo kukukomena, peepe kubikka lubo intalisyo yakusanduka kuzwa kumilimu itola kulufu ayalusyomo kunembo lyaLeza, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />anjiisyo atala alubbapatizyo, kubikka maanza, kubuka kwabafu, alubeta lutamani. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Alimwi eechi tuyoochichita kuti Leza wazumizya.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Nkaambo tachikonzyeki kubweedezya lubo kukusanduka kwabaabo bakali bamwinikilwa kale, bakalabila chipo chakujulu, mpawo baba bamwi baMuuya Usalala, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />alimwi bakalabila bubotu bwajwi lyaLeza anguzu zyachiindi chichiza, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />kuti eelyo balipeda kukuleya, mbukunga bagankamina Mwana Mulombe waLeza akuyanda kwabo akumusonsya antanganana.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Nkaambo inyika yakanywa imvula eeyo iwa lyoonse atala anjiyo, akuzyala michelo iyandika kulibaabo mbiyakaliminwa, itambula chilongezyo kuli Leza. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Pesi kuti yazyala maamvwa azinchenya, tayigwasyi pe alimwi ngayaba afwiifwi kutukwa; mamanino aayo nkuumpwa.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Nibayandwa, nikuba twaambule oobu, kakuli kuti muchiimo chanu, tumvwa choonzyo azintu zilimbubo eezyo zyalufutuko. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Nkaambo Leza tapilingene kapati mbuli kuti alube milimu yanu aluyando ndumwakatondezya nkaambo kakwe mukuwutawukila basalali, mbuli mbumuchichita. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Alimwi tuyandisya kuti awumwi wanu atondeezye chiyandisyo chikozyene mukuyeeya lusinizyo luzulide lwabulangilizi mane kumamanino, <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />kuchitila kuti mutabi bakandu, pesi mube bayiiya aabo mukwiinda mulusyomo amoyo mulamfu bayookona zisyomezyo.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chisyomezyo ChaLeza Chakasimpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Nkaambo Leza naakachita chisyomezyo kuli Abburahamu, mbukunga taakachilikwe mupati pe wakukonka aawe, wakakonka alwakwe, <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />kaamba kuti, “Choonzyo ndiyookulongezya akukuvuzya.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Alimwi nguAbburahamu, kaali wakakakatila chamoyo mulamfu, wakajana chisyomezyo. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Bantu bakonka abapati kwiinda lwabo, alimwi mukukazyana kwabo koonse chikonke nchichisinizyo chakumamanino. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Aboobo Leza naakayanda kutondeezya zyiindilide kukombelezya kuli basikukona chisyomezyo chiimo chitasanduki chamulimu wakwe, wakali kuzichita achikonke, <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />kuchitila kuti mukwiinda muzintu zibili zitasanduki, muli eecho Leza nchatakonzyi kutondeezya kuti nchakubeja, iswe nitwakachija kukuyuba ngatulaba ansungwaazyo ilaanguzu kukumweya bulangilizi bubikkidwe kunembo lyesu. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Tujisi eechi mbuli choonzyo andombondeya yaMuuya mpawo chiliimvwi, bulangilizi oobo bunjila mukati kusule kwamudabba wachisitikizyo chabusena busalala, <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />ooko Jesu nkwakayinka mbuli simweenda kunembo nkaambo kesu, kaali waba mupayizi mupati walyoonse mukwiinda mumabambe aMelikkizedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Mupayizi Melikkizedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Nkaambo ooyu Melikkizedeki, mwami waSalemu, mupayizi waLeza Simajulu, wakaswaanana aAbburahamu naakabweeda kuzwa kukujeya bami mpawo wakamulongezya, <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />alimwi kulinguwe Abburahamu wakamupa chaakkumi chazintu zyoonse. Nguumutaanzi, mukupandulula zina lyakwe, mwami wabululami, alimwi nguumwami waSalemu, chaamba kuti, mwami waluumuno. <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Takwe wisi nikuba banyina nikuba zyalani, alimwi takwe matalikilo amazuba nikuba mamanino abuumi, pesi katondeezya Mwana Mulombe waLeza ooyo uyinkilila anembo mubupayizi kwalyoonse.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Amulange kuti mupati biyeni! Abburahamu sikale wesu wakamupa chaakkumi anzyaakabanyanzya. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Abaabo balunyungu lwaLevi aabo batambula mulimu wabupayizi balijisi mulayizyo mumulawu wakubweza chakkumi kuzwa kubantu, chaamba kuti, kuzwa kuli babunyina, nikuba kuti aaba alubo ndunyungu kuli Abburahamu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Pesi ooyu mwaalumi utakwe lunyungu lwaLevi wakatambula zyaakkumi kuzwa kuli Abburahamu mpawo wamulongezya ooyo wakali azisyomezyo. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Taakwe kudoneeka pe kuti ulimunsi ulongezegwa awuli aatala. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Aawa zyaakkumi zitambulwa abantu bafwa, kuli lumwi lubazu, awumwi ooyo ujisi bukamboni bwakuti ulapona. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Umwi ulakonzya kwaamba kuti Levi lwakwe, ooyo utambula zyaakkumi, wakaliya zyakkumi mukwiinda muli Abburahamu, <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />nkaambo wakachili muchibuno chasyayinakulu aawo Melikkizedeki naakamuswaniya.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Lino naa kululamikwa kwakali kujanwa mukwiinda mubupayizi bwabuLevi nkaambo munsi aako bantu bakatambula mulawu, niinzi chimbi chiyandikana inga kulaba umbi na mupayizi unga ulabuka musule akulayilila kwaMelikkizedeki, kwiinda umwi uwunikidwe akulayilila kwaAroni? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Nkaambo kuti kwaaba kubambulula mubupayizi, alawo mulawu weelede kubambululwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Nkaambo ooyo wambuulwa atala azintu eezi uzwa kuli uumbi mukowa, ooko kutakwe wakaliwutawukide kuchipayililo. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Nkaambo kulizibikene kuti Mwami wesu wakazwa kumukowa waJuda, alimwi mukweendelana amukowa ooyo Mozesi ngwatakwe nchakaamba pe atala abapayizi.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mupayizi Uumbi Ulimbuli Melikkizedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Eechi chiba antanganana kwiindilila naa kwabuka umwi mupayizi muchiimo chaMelikkizedeki, <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />wakaba mupayizi, peepe mukwiinda muliziyandika atala amulawu wazyalani pesi anguzu zyabuumi butamani. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Nkaambo kuli bukamboni atala anguwe buti, “Uyooba mupayizi kwalyoonse, mukulayila kwaMelikizedeki.” <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Munzila imwi, mulawu wakale ubikkidwe ambali nkaambo kakukompama kwawo akubula mulimu, <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />nkaambo mulawu taakwe chintu nchiwakabeleka pe chibotu, muli imwi nzila, bulangilizi buli mbubo buleetwa, mukwiinda muli mbubo butusweenzya afwiifwi kuliLeza.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Alimwi peepe kakutakwe chikonke. Aabo bakaba bapayizi lutaanzi bakabweeza milimu yabo kakutakwe chikonke pe, <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />pesi eechi chakachitwa achikonke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Mwami wakakonka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">alimwi taakwe nayoosandula muzeezo wakwe pe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Uyooba mupayizi kwalyoonse.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Eechi chichita kuti Jesu abe lusinizyo lwachizuminano chilimbubo.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Bapayizi bakale bakali bayiingi mumweelwe, nkaambo bakali kukwabililwa alufu mukwiinkila anembo mumulimu, <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />pesi ooyo ujisi bupayizi bwakwe kwalyoonse, nkaambo uyinkilila anembo kwalyoonse. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Nkikaako ulakonzya kwachiindi choonse kufutula aabo basweena afwiifwi kuliLeza mukwiinda mulinguwe, mbukunga ulapona lyoonse mukubakumbilila.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Nkaambo kwakali kweelela kuti tube amupayizi mupati uliboobu, usalala, utakwe kampenda, utakwe kabata, upambukene abasizibi, usumpukide ataala amajulu. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Taakwe cheelelo chakuchita, mbuli aabo bapayizi bapati, bapa zipayizyo mazuba woonse, lutaanzi nkaambo kazibi zyakwe mpawo azeezyo zyabantu. Wakachichita eechi kamwi kwalyoonse naakalipeda mwini. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Nkaambo, mulawu usala bantu mubukompami bwabo mbuli bapayizi bapati, pesi ijwi lyachikonke, lyakaza musule amulawu, lisala Mwana Mulombe wakalulamikwa kwalyoonse ngwakasala.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Mupayizi Wesu Mupati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Lino chipati muli nzitwaambuula nchechi, tujisi mupayizi mupati uliboobo, ooyo ukkede kuluboko lwakululyo lwachuuno chaSinguzu kujulu, <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />simulimu mubusena busalala adyumba lyachoonzyo lyakayakwa aMwami peepe amuntu.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Nkaambo woonse mupayizi mupati usalilwa kupa zipo azipayizyo, anu kuti chileelede eechi kumupayizi mupati lubo kuti abe achimwi chakupa. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Lino koonzyo wakali anyika, teewakali kunooba mupayizi nikuba abuniini pe, mbukunga kulibapayizi aabo bapa zipo mukwiinda kumulawu. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Bakutawuka mukozyanisyo amunzwiide wabusena busalala bwakujulu, nkaambo Mozesi naakali wayanda kuyaka dyumba, wakalayililwa aLeza, kati, “Ubone kuti wachita zyoonse mbuli munzila njuwakatondezegwa aayo achilundu.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Pesi mbuli mbukubede, Kkirisitu wakajana mulimu mupati ulimbuli uyindilide kubota kwiinda ooyo wakale mbuli chizuminano wiimaakati zilimbubo, mbukunga chiliyakidwe azisyomezyo zilimbubo.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Nkaambo kuti eecho chizuminano chakale teechakali abubi, teekwakali kunooba mabambe achabili pe. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Nkaambo ujana mulandu ambabo naa waamba kuti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Mazuba ayoosika, mbwaamba Mwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">aawo nindiyoochita chizuminano chipya aŋanda yaIzirayeli alimwi aŋanda yaJuda;<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />peepe mbuli chizuminano nchindakachita abamawisi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">mubuzuba oobo mbundakababweza ajanza kandibazulwida kuzwa munyika yaIjiputi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">nkaambo tee bakayinkilila anembo pe muchizuminano changu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">alimwi aboobo tandikwe nindakabaswiilizya pe, mbwaamba Mwami.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Eechi nchichizuminano nchindiyoochita aŋanda yaIzirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">nikuyooyinda mazuba aayo, mbwaamba Mwami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Ndiyobikka milawu yangu mumiyeeyo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">akuyilemba amyoyo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">alimwi ndiyoba Leza wabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">alimwi bayooba bantu bangu.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Alimwi tabakwe kuyoyiisya beenzunyina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">nikuba woonse mukulana wakwe, kati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Muzibe Mwami.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Nkaambo boonse bayoondiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">kuzwa kumuniini wabo kuyosika kumupati.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Nkaambo ndiyooba aluse kuzibi zyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">alimwi tandikwe kuyooyeeya limbi lubo pe zibi zyabo.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Mukwaambuula achizuminano chipya uchita eecho chakale mbuli chitakwe mulimu. Alimwi eecho chiliikubula mulimu akukulumpala chalibambilila kumana.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Kukomba Kwaansi Akwakujulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Lino nikuba chizuminano chitaanzi chakali amilawu yakukomba abusena busala bwaanyika. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Nkaambo idyumba lyakali lyabambwa, lyakunze, oomo mwakali chibikkilo chazimwinikisyo atebuli achinkwa chipayililwa kuBuliwo bwakwe, chitegwa Busena Busalala. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Kusule lyachisitilizyo kwakali busena bwachibili mudyumba butegwa Busena Busalalisya, <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />bwakali achipayililo changolide chatununkilizyo abbokesi lyachizuminano livumbidwe mabazu woonse angolinde, lyakali anongo yangolide yakali nyampwide mana, amusako waAroni ooyo wakali syuukide, amabwe mapapali abili achizuminano; <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />atala abbokesi kwakali maKkerubbimu abulemu akali vumbide chuuno chaluse. Atala azintu eezi lino tatukonzyi kwambuula zinikide pe.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Kubambilila ooku kwakali kuchitwa kale, bapayizi bakali kunjila choonse chiindi mudyumba lyakunze, kabachita milimu yabo; <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />pesi mubusena bwamukati mupayizi mupati luzutu nguunjila, alimwi unjila kamwi amunyaka, alimwi peepe katabwezede bulowa oobo bwakulipayilila azibi zyabantu nzibakachita akulubizya kwabantu. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Acheechi Muuya Usalala ulatondeezya kuti inzila iya mubusena busalala tiinajulwa kufumbwa idyumba taanzi kalichiliwo <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />eechi nchitondeezyo chachiindi eechino. Eechi chaamba kuti, zipo azipayizyo zilapedekezegwa eezyo zitakonzyi kululamika miyeeyo yamukombi, <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />pesi zibeleka biyo azyakulya akunywa azimwi zyakulisalazya zisiyene, milawu yamubili ilabikkwa mane kuchiindi chakubukuluka.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Pesi Kkirisitu naakaliboniya mbuli mupayizi mupati wazintu zibotu eezyo zyaza kale, eelyo mukwiinda mudyumba pati alyiindilide kukubota peepe lyakachitwa amaanza abantu, zyaamba kuti, peepe lyabulenge oobu <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />wakanjila kamwi kwalyoonse muBusena Busalala, kabwezede peepe bulowa bwampongo akanamani pesi bulowa bwakwe lwakwe, ooko nkuyanduula kunununwa kwalyoonse. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Nkaambo kuti abulowa bwampongo abasipule akusansiilwa adyota lyampwizi kwabantu basofwede kakusalazya kukusalazigwa kwamubili, <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />buyoyinda biyeni bulowa bwaKkirisitu, ooyo mukwiinda aMuuya walyoonse wakalipeda lwakwe katakwe kampenda kuli Leza, ngamusalazye miyeeyo yanu kuzwa mumilimu ifwide kuti mukutawukile Leza upona.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Nkikaako nguusimwiimaakati wachizuminano chipya, kuchitila kuti aabo bayitwa bakatambule chisyomezyo chalukono lutamani, mbukunga lufu lwakwe lwakaba oolo lubanununa kuzwa kuzibi zyakachitwa munsi achizuminano chitaanzi.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Nkaambo aawo alikwaabanisigwa kwalubono, lufu lwayooyo wakaluchita lweelede lube abukamboni. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Nkaambo kuyanda kubeleka luzutu kulufu, mbukunga takuli kwakwaangila kufumbwa luzutu ooyo wakaluchita kachipona. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Mbukunga nikuba chizuminano chitaanzi teechakachitwa kakutakwe bulowa. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Nkaambo malayilile woonse amulawu naakaambulwa aMozesi kubantu boonse, wakabweza bulowa bwatunamani ampongo, ameenda abuluba busalala akatabi kamusamu utegwa hisopu, alimwi wakasansiila ibbuku lwalyo abantu boonse, <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />kati, “Oobu mbuubulowa bwachizuminano Leza nchaakamulayilila kuti muchiswiilile.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Alimwi munzila njiyeeyo wakasansiila abulowa idyumba azibelesyo zyoonse zyakali kubelesegwa mukukomba. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Choonzyo, aansi amulawu zintu zyiingi zyazyo zisalazigwa abulowa, alimwi kakutakwe kutilwa kwabulowa taakwe kulekelelwa kwazibi pe.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chipayizyo ChaKkirisitu Nchiigwisya Chibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Aboobo kwakaleelede kuti zikozyanisyo zyazintu zyakujulu kazisalazigwa mbuli oobu, pesi zintu zyakujulu lwazyo ziyanda zipayizyo zilimbubo kwiinda eezi. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Nkaambo Kkirisitu wakanjila, peepe mubusena busalala bwakachitwa amaanza abantu pe, nchichikozyanisyo biyo chakasimpe, pesi kujulu lwako, lino ulaliboniya mubuliwo bwaLeza mubusena bwesu. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Nikuba kuti wakaleelede alipede lwakwe twindulwidwe, mbuli mupayizi mupati mbwanjila Busena Busalalisya munyaka amunyaka abulowa butali bwakwe; <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />nkaambo eelyo wakaleelede kupenzegwa twiindulwidwe kuzwa kuntalisyo yanyika. Pesi mbuli mbukubede, wakaliboniya kamwi kwalyoonse kumamanino achiindi kuti agwisye chibi akulipayizya. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Alimwi mbuli mbuchakasalwa nkaambo kabantu kuti bafwe kamwi, alimwi kunembo aboobo kuza lubeta, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />aboobo Kkirisitu, kaabilidwe kamwi kuti abweze zibi zyabayingi, uyooliboniya kachibili, peepe kuzoolangana azibi zyabantu bayiingi pesi kuzoofutula aabo bamulindila achabusungu.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Nkaambo mbukunga mulawu ulijisi pesi munzwiide biyo wazintu zibotu zichiza kwiinda chachibumbwa chachoonzyo chazyiitiko eezi, teengachilaba pe, azipayizyo nzizyo eezyo zipegwa lubbe munyaka amunyaka, zilulamika aabo baswena afwiifwi. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Muli chimwi chiindi, teenikuli bakaleka kuzipeda, kuti bakombi kabali bakasalazigwa, nikuli tabachiyeeyi limbi pe achibi? <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Pesi muzipayizyo eezi kuli chiyubulusyo chachibi munyaka amunyaka. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Nkaambo tachikonzeki pe kuti bulowa bwabasipule ampongo bugwisye zibi.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Nkikaako, Kkirisitu naakaza munyika wakati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Zipayizyo azipo eezyo nzimutakwe mwakayanda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">pesi mwakandibambila mubili;<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />teemwakabotelwa pe muzipayizyo zyakuumpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">azipayizyo zyachibi.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Eelyo ndakati, ‘Laanga, ndili aano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">ndaza kuzoochita kuyanda kwako, O Leza,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">mbuli mbukulembedwe atala andime mubbuku lyamulawu.”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Naakamba eezi zili atala kuti, “Inywe tamuyandi nikuba kubotelwa muzipayizyo azipo zyakuumpa azipo zyachibi” eezi zipegwa mukwiinda kumulawu, <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />eelyo wakayungizya wati, “Laanga, ndaza lino, kuzoochita kuyanda kwako.” Ujeya chitaanzi kuchitila kuti atangune chachibili. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Alimwi ankaambo kakuyanda ooko twakasalazigwa mukwiinda achipayizyo chamubili waJesu Kkirisitu kamwi kwalyoonse.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Alimwi mupayizi woonse ulayimikila buzuba abuzuba kumulimu wakwe, kapayizya zipayizyo zyiindulidwe zikozyene, zitakonzyi kugwisya zibi pe. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Pesi Kkirisitu naakamana kupeda kwachiindi choonse chipayizyo chimwi chazibi, wakakkala aansi kuluboko lwakululyo lwaLeza, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />eelyo ulalindila mane basinkondonyina bakachitwe chuuno chamawulu aakwe. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Nkaambo achipayizyo chimwi kwachiindi choonse wakalulamika aabo bakasalazigwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Alimwi Muuya Usalala waamba kuti ujisi bukamboni kulindiswe kuti,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Eechi nchiichizuminano nchindiyoochita ambabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">mumazuba aayo, mbwaamba Mwami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">ndiyobikka milawu yangu amyoyo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">akwiilemba mumiyeeyo yabo,”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />eelyo ulayungizya lubo kati, “Tandikwe kuyoyeeya zibi zyabo amilimu yabo mibi limbi pe.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Ooko kuli kulekelelwa kwazeezi, takuchikwe kupayizigwa kwachibi limbi pe.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atuswene Afwiifwi KuliLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Nkikaako, bakwesu, mbukunga tujisi busichaamba bwakunjila Mubusena Busalalisya abulowa bwaJesu, <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />anzila mpya ipona njaakatujulida mukwiinda muchisitilizyo, chaamba kuti, kwiinda mumubili wakwe. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Alimwi mbukunga tujisi mupayizi mupati waŋanda yaLeza, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />ngatuswene afwiifwi amoyo wachoonzyo uzwide lusinizyo luzwa kulusyomo, amyoyo yesu kiisansidwe kayisalala kuzwa kumuyeeyo wabubi amibili yesu kiisambide ameenda loko. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Ngatujatisye kulyambilila kwabulangilizi bwesu butakwe kusunzuluka, nkaambo ooyo wakatusyomezya ulisyomekede; <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />alimwi ngatugame kusungwazyaniya umwi awumwi kuluyando amilimu mibotu, <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />peepe kuleka kubungana, mbuli bamwi mbubachita, pesi kusungwazya umwi awumwi, alimwi kapati mbuli mbumubona kuti Buzuba oobo buli afwiifwi.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Nkaambo kuti twabisya achaali katuli twatambula luzibo lwakasimpe, takuchikwe chipayizyo chimbi chichicheede chazibi, <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />pesi lubeta luyoosya, abukali bwamulilo wakuumpya basinkondonyina baLeza. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Kufumbwa muntu utyola mulawu waMozesi ulajeegwa kakutakwe luse pe kubukamboni bwabakamboni babili nikuba batatu. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Nchisubulo chiindilide biyeni nchimuyeeya kuti uyoojana ooyo muntu ulyata mawulu aMwana Mulombe waLeza, akutalemeka bulowa bwachizuminano oobo mbwaakasalazigwa aabo, akutukila Muuya waluzyalo? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Nkaambo tulimuzi ooyo wakati, “Kubweedezya nkukwangu, ndiyoliya.” Alimwi alubo, “Mwami uyoobeteka bantu bakwe.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Nchintu chiyoosya kuwida mumaanza aLeza upona.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Pesi ngamuyeeye mazuba akayinda, kamuli mwamwinikilwa, mwakakakatila inkondo mpati akupenzegwa, <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />muli chimwi chiindi kamupenzegwa akusukuusigwa antanganana, achimwi chiindi kamuli kubasungwaazya abaabo bakali kuchitwa oobo. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Nkaambo mwakali aluzyalo kubaange, alimwi mwakazumina alukondo nimwakali kubwezelwa buvubi bwanu, mbukunga mwakalizi kuti inywe lwanu mujisi buvubi bulimbubo alimwi bukkalilila. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Nkikaako mutasowi busichaamba bwanu, buli ampindu mpati. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Nkaambo inywe mweelede kuba alukakatilo, kuti mwachita kuyanda kwaLeza muyootambula eecho chakasyomezegwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />“Eelyo mbukunga mukayindi kaniini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">alimwi ooyo uza uyooza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">takwe kuyoochedwa pe;<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />pesi basalali bangu bayoopona alusyomo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">alimwi kuti wabweeda musule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">muuya wangu tuukwe kuyoobotelwa pe mulinguwe.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Pesi tatuli bankamu ibweedela musule pe abanyonyoonwa, pesi tuli bankamu yalusyomo akubamba myuuya yesu.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Lusyomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Lino lusyomo ndusinizyo lwazintu nzitulangilila, kuzumina zintu zitaboneki. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Nkaambo kandulo bantu bakale bakatambula kuzumininwa kwaLeza kubotu.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Alusyomo tumvwisisisya kuti inyika yakalengwa ajwi lyaLeza, kuchitila kuti chibonwa chakachitwa kuzwa kuzintu zitalibonyi pe.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Alusyomo Abbelo wakapa chipayizyo kuliLeza chitambulika kwiinda chaKkayini, mukwiinda mulinchicho mwaakajana kuzumininwa mbuli musalali, nkaambo Leza wakalijisi bukamboni wakakondwa kuzipo zyakwe, wakafwa, pesi mukwiinda mulusyomo lwakwe uchaambula.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Alusyomo Inokki wakatolwa kujulu kuchitila kuti ataboni lufu pe; alimwi teewakajanika pe, nkaambo Leza wakali wamubweza. Lino katana bwezegwa wakabalwa mbuli wakakondezya Leza. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Alimwi atakwe lusyomo tachikonzeki kumubotezya. Nkaambo kufumbwa uswena afwiifwi kuliLeza weelede kusyoma kuti mpali alimwi kuti ulalumbula aabo bamuyanduula.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Alusyomo Nowa, naakachenjezegwa aLeza atala azintu zitanabonwa, wakaswiilizya mpawo wayaka bwaato bupati bwakufutula baŋanda yakwe; acheechi wakiipa mulandu inyika mpawo wakakoona busalali oobo buza alusyomo.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Alusyomo Abburahamu wakaswiilila naakayitwa kuti aye kubusena oobo nkwakakutambula lukono; mpawo wakeenda, katazi nkwakalikuya. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Alusyomo wakeenda kunyika yachisyomezyo, mbuli munyika yabweenzu, kakkala mumadumba aAyizekki aJakkobbu, basikukona aamwi anguwe muchisyomezyo chimwi. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Nkaambo wakalanga kunembo kuchisi chakali antalisyo, eecho sikuchita asikuyaka kakuli nguLeza.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Alusyomo Sara lwakwe wakatambula nguzu zyakumita, nikuba kuti chiindi chakali chayinda, mbukunga wakamubweza kasyomede ooyo wakamusyomezya. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Nkikaako kuzwa kumwaalumi umwi, alimwi we kali mbuli muntu ufwide, kwakazyalwa lunyungu lwiingi mbuli nyenyezi zyakujulu alimwi mbuli tubwe twamuse tutakonzeki kubala tuli kunkomwe yalwizi.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Aaba boonse bakafwa mulusyomo, peepe kabali batambula zyakali zyasyomezegwa, pesi kabali bazibona mpawo baambuula atala anzizyo kule, alimwi kabazumina kuti mbeenzu abanakweenda anyika. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Nkaambo bantu baambula bazibikka antanganana kuti bayanduula nyika yabo. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Kuti bakali kuyeeya atala anyika eeyo njibakazwa, nikuli bakali kunoojana mweenya wakubweeda. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Pesi mbuli mbukubede, bayandisya inyika ilimbubo, nkukuti, yakujulu. Nkikaako Leza takwe bweeme pe kuti aambwe kuti nguLeza wabo, nkaambo wakababambila chisi.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Alusyomo Abburahamu, naakasunkwa, wakapa Ayizekki, alimwi ooyo wakatambula zisyomezyo wakali libambilide kupa mwana wakwe umwi luzutu, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />ooyo wakaambwa kuti, “Mukwiinda muli Ayizekki lunyungu lwako luyoowunikwa.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Wakayeeya kuti Leza ulakonzya kubusya bantu nikuba kuzwa kubafu; anukuti, mumaambila mbali, wakamutambula lubo.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Alusyomo Ayizekki wakalongezya Jakkobbu aIsawu azilongezyo zyakachili kuyobuza.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Alusyomo Jakkobbu, naakalikuya kukufwa, wakalongezya bana balombe baJozefu boonse, wakavuntama mpawo wakomba kasiminide mutwe atala amusako wakwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Alusyomo Jozefu, kumamanino abuumi bwakwe, alimwi wakaamba atala akulonga kwaba Izirayeli mpawo wakapa malayilile atala akubambwa kwamafuwa aakwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Alusyomo Mozesi, naakazyalwa, wakasiswa abazyali bakwe kwamyeezi iitatu, nkaambo bakabona kuti mwana wakali mubotu; alimwi teebakayoowa mulawu wamwami pe.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Alusyomo Mozesi, naakakomena, wakakaka kwitwa kuti mwana wamwana musimbi waFaro, <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />wakasala kupenzegwa antoomwe abantu baLeza kwiinda kubotelwa bunone bwachibi kwachiindi chiniini. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Wakasala kupenzegwa nkaambo kabuvubi bupati bwaKkirisitu kwiinda buvubi bwaIjiputi, nkaambo wakalangilila kumpindu.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Alusyomo wakasiya Ijiputi, katakwe buyofu bwalunyemo lwaMwami; nkaambo wakakakatila mbuli kuti ubwene ooyo utabonwi. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Alusyomo wakabamba Pobwe Lyakwiindilila lwabaJuda akusansa bulowa, kuchitila kuti Sikunyonyoona wabana bataanzi atabagumi.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Alusyomo bantu bakazubuka Lwizi Lusalala mbuli kuti ninyika njumu; pesi baIjiputi, nibakayezya kuchita oobo, bakanikila.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Alusyomo bulambo bwaJerikko bwakakolomoka nibakamana kubuzyunguluka bulaambo kwamazuba alimusanu aabili. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Alusyomo Rahabbu sibwamu taakafwa amwi pe abaabo bataswiilila, nkaambo wakali watambula basikutwela achabuuya.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Alimwi ndaambuule zyiingi zili biyeni? Nkaambo chiindi chamana kuti ndimwaambile atala aGidiyoni aBbarakki aSamusoni aJefuta waDevidi aSamuyeli abasinsimi. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />aabo mukwiinda mulusyomo bakazunda maami, bakabikka bululami, bakatambula zisyomezyo, bakajala milomo yabalavu, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />bakazima bukali bwamulilo, bakachija kuyasa kwapanga, bakajana nguzu kuzwa kubukompami, bakaba anguzu munkondo, bakazunda basilumamba bazwa kule akuchija. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Banakazi bakatambula bafwide babo akubuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Bamwi bakapenzegwa, bakakaka kutambula kwaangununwa, kuti bakabuke lubo kubuumi buli mbubo. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Bamwi bakapenzegwa kukuweelwa akuumwa, alimwi nikuba kwaangwa anketani akutolwa muntolongo. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Bakadonkolwa, bakaduunsulwa akati, bakajeegwa apanga; bakali kweenda kabasama zikwiye zyambelele azyampongo, kabafwaba, kabapenzegwa, kabajatwa bubi, <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />inyika teeyakabachita beelela pe, bakali kuyingayila munkanda amuzilundu, alimwi mumaseenengo amumagolo anyika.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Alimwi boonse aaba, nikuba bakazumininwa alusyomo lwabo, teebakatambula pe eecho nchibakasyomezegwa, <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />mbukunga Leza wakali chibwene kale chimwi chili mbubo kuli ndiswe, kuti kuteensi ndiswe teebakali kuchitwa baluleme pe.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Leza Taata Wesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Nkikaako, mbukunga tuzyungulukidwe ajoba pati lyabakamboni, aswebo ngatusowe mukuli woonse, achibi chikkala kachili afwiifwi, alimwi atuchijaane akukakatila mwindilano ubikkidwe kunembo lyesu, <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />katulangide kuli Jesu ngutalika awumaninizya kabotu walusyomo lwesu, ooyo nkaambo kalukondo lwakabikkwa kunembo lyakwe wakakakatila achiingano, katakwe bweme pe, alimwi ulikkede kuluboko lwakululyo lwachuuno chaLeza.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Kamumuyeeya ooyo wakakakatila kuzwa kuli basizibi kupenzegwa kuliboobo atala anguwe, kuchitila kuti mutamani nguzu nikuba kutyompwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Mukukataazika kwanu atala achibi tamunakakatila pe mane kuyooosika akutilwa kwabulowa bwanu. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Alimwi mwaluba kalena ijwi lyaamba kuti muli mbuli bana balombe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mwanaangu, utawubansyi lulayo lwaMwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">nikuba kusweekelwa kusungwala naa wapegwa chisubulo anguwe.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Nkaambo Mwami ulamulaya ooyo ngwayanda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">alimwi ulapa chisubulo kumwana woonse ooyo ngwatambula.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Nkukululamikwa ooko nkumweelede kukakatila. Leza umubweza mbuli bana; nkaambo mwana ulibiyeni ooyo wisi ngwatalayi pe? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Kuti mwachaala kamutalayidwe pe, munzila bamwi boonse mubakayinda, eelyo tamweesi bana loko pe bakuzyala. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Kunze kwacheechi, twakali abamataata besu bamunyika kuti batulaye alimwi twakabalemeka. Tatweeledena kulibombya kapati kuli Taata wamyuuya mpawo tupone? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Nkaambo bakatulaya kwachiindi chiniini biyo mukuyanda kwabo, pesi ulatulaya mububotu bwesu, kuti tukakonzye kwaabilana busalali bwakwe. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Nkaambo chiindi choonse kulayigwa kulangika kakuchisa kwiinda kubotezya; muchiindi kulazyala muchelo waluumuno wabusalali kulibaabo bakayiisigwa andulo.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malayilile Amachenjezyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Nkikaako ngamunyampule maboko aanu aayo alengelede mpawo moolole mazwi aanu akompeme, <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />alimwi mululamike inzila zyamawulu aanu, kuchitila kuti eecho chilebukide chitadyunkuki kuzwa kuchisiko, pesi kuti chipone.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Amuzuzaanine luumuno abantu boonse, akupona buumi busalala nkaambo taakwe uyoobona Mwami katakwe buumi oobo. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Amubone kuti taakwe pe uyookachilwa kujana luzyalo lwaLeza; oolo lutakwe “muyanda ulula” usyuuka akweeta penzi, alimwi anguwo bayiingi balasofwala; <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />kuti kutabi naba umwi uba sibwaamu nikuba utakwe bunaLeza mbuli Isawu, ooyo wakawuzya lukono lwabupati bwakwe nkaambo kakulya chimwi. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Nkaambo mulizi kuti nikwakayinda, naakayanda kuti akone chilongezyo, wakakakwa, nkaambo taakajana chiindi chakusanduka pe, nikuba kuti wakachiyanduula amisozi.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Nkaambo teemwakaza kuli eecho chijatika pe, mulilo uyaka, amudima, akusiya aluwo, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />akulila kwamweembo ajwi eelyo lili amabala akachita kuti basikuswiilizya bakumbile kuti kutabi ijwi lichaambwa lubo kulimbabo. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Nkaambo teebakachili kukakatila pe kumalayilile aayo ngibakapegwa, “Kuti nikuba munyama waguma chilundu, uyoodonkolwa.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Nichoonzyo, bwakalikuyoosya busena Mozesi mbwakali kwaamba kuti, “Ndakaankama akuyoowa.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Pesi mwaza kuChilundu chaZiyoni akuchisi chaLeza upona, Jerusalemu wakujulu, akubaangelo bayingi babungene mupobwe, <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />alimwi akumbungano yabataanzi kukuzyala kwabo balembedwe kujulu, akumubetesi uliLeza waboonse akumyuuya yabantu basalali bakalulamikwa, <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />akuli Jesu, sikwimaakati wachizuminano chipya, akubulowa busansiilwa bwambuula luzyalo lupati kwiinda bulowa bwaAbbelo.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Amubone kuti tamumukaki pe ooyo uliikwambuula. Nkaambo kuti teebakachija pe nibakamukaka ooyo wakabachenjezya anyika, buche biyo mbutiyoochija naa twamukaka ooyo uchenjezya kuzwa kujulu. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Ijwi lyakwe eelyo lyakazunganiya inyika; pesi lino wasyomezya kati, “Kakuli tandikwe kuyoozunganiya nyika luzutu pe pesi alubo ajulu.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Eechi chaambyo, “Kakuli lubo,” chitondezya kugwisigwa kwacheecho chakazunganisigwa, mbuli eecho chakachitwa, kuchitila kuti eecho chitakonzyi kuzunganisigwa chichaale.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Nkikaako mbukunga twakatambula bwami atube akulumba ooko kutakwe kuyozunganisigwa pe, alimwi atupe kuli Leza bukombi butambulika, akulemeka akuyoowa; <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Det 4:24</ref>.</char></note> nkaambo Leza wesu mulilo unyonyoona.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Kubotezya Leza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Amuleke luyando lwabunyina lweendeleele. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Mutaleki kutondeezya buuya kubeenzu, nkaambo kaboobo bamwi bakasamawusya baangelo kabatazi pe. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Amubayeeye aabo bali muntolongo, mbuli kuti muli aamwi muntolongo; abaabo basonsyegwa, mbukunga anywebo muli mumubili upenzegwa.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Amuleke makwataano achitwe mukulemeka akati kaboonse, alimwi bulo bwamakwatano butasofwazigwi pe; nkaambo Leza uyoobabeteka baamu abasimamambe.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Mubambe buumi bwanu mutabi basikuyanda mali, alimwi mukkutikane azeezyo nzimulaazyo; nkaambo wakati, “Tandikwe kuyoosiya pe nikuba kuyookulekelezya.”<verse eid="HEB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Anukuti ngatulaamba abusichaamba kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Mwami mugwasyi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">taakwe nchindiyoyoowa pe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">niinzi muntu nchanga ulachita kulindime?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Kamuyeeya bazulidi banu, aabo bakamwaambila ijwi lyaLeza; muyeeye mbubakali kupona, alimwi mwiiye lusyomo lwabo. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Jesu Kkirisitu nguunguwe jilo asunu akwalyoonse. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Mutaleyesegwi nkaambo kamisyobomisyobo yanjiisyo italuleme; nkaambo nchibotu kuti moyo usungazigwe aluzyalo, peepe atala milawu yazyakulya imwi, eeyo itakwe yakabapa mpindu bayitobelezya.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Tujisi chipayililo eecho bakutawukila dyumba nchibatakwe cheelelo chakulida. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Nkaambo mibili yabanyama aabo bali abulowa bweetwa mubusena busalalisya amupayizi mupati mbuli chipayizyo chachibi zilawumpwa anze alubuwa. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Aboobo alubo Jesu wakapenzegwa kunze amulyango wachisi kuti asalazye bantu mukwiinda mubulowa bwakwe. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Nkikaako ngatwiinke kulinguwe anze alubuwa, mpawo tukabweze kusukuusigwa nkwakakakatila. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Nkaambo aano tatukwe chisi chalyoonse pe, pesi tuyanduula chisi eecho chiyobuza. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Mukwiinda mulinguwe eelyo atwiinkilile anembo akupa chipayizyo chakulumbayizya kuli Leza, chaamba kuti, muchelo wamilomo eeyo yaamba izina lyakwe. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Mutaleki kuchita chibotu akwaabilana nzimujisi, nkaambo zipayizyo ziliboobu zilakonda kuli Leza.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Amuswiilile bazulidi banu akulifwiinsya kulimbabo; nkaambo mbibalanga myuuya yanu, mbuli bantu bayoobuzisigwa. Mubaleke bachite eechi mulukondo, alimwi peepe mukunyontoka, nkaambo eecho tachikwe kuyoomubotela pe.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Mutukombele, nkaambo tuli achoonzyo kuti tuli amiyeeyo ili antanganana, katuyandisya kuti tuchite abulemu muzintu zyoonse. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Ndamukumbila kapati kuti muchite eechi kuchitila kuti ndibukulusigwe kulindinywe akufwambana.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inkombyo Yakujala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Lino Leza waluumuno wakabusya lubo kuzwa kulufu Mwami wesu Jesu, mweembeli mupati wambelele, abulowa bwachizuminano chalyoonse, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />amupe zintu zyoonse zibotu kuti muchite kuyanda kwakwe, kaliikubeleka mulindinywe eecho chimukonda mumeso aakwe, mukwiinda muli Jesu Kkirisitu, kuli nguwe akube bulemu kwalyoonse alyoonse. Ameni.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majwi Akumamanino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Ndamukumbila, nibakwesu, mujatilile kumajwi aangu akusungwazya, nkaambo ndakamulembela mubufwiifwi. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Mweelede kumvwisisya kuti mukwesu Timoti wakaangununwa, nguunguwe ngundiyomubona aamwi naa wasika chakufwambana.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Mujuzye bazulidi boonse banu abasalali boonse. Aabo bazwa kuItali balamujuzya.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Luzyalo lube andinywe moonse.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>